{"3193920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fatal Train", "steam_appid": 3193920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.poster.avif?t=1788201849\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.webm?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.mp4?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ladies and gentlemen, welcome aboard the Fatal Train.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The killer is hiding among the passengers of the Fatal Train. You and up to three friends have taken on this difficult case - or you're taking it alone, which is worse. But honestly, does anyone care with everything else going on?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ENJOY THE RIDE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/528f1a5de62ac7441ba7f518089bb7e8.poster.avif?t=1788201849\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/528f1a5de62ac7441ba7f518089bb7e8.webm?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/528f1a5de62ac7441ba7f518089bb7e8.mp4?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The train passes through an ENORMOUS number of places, and every one of them leaves something behind. The carriages can catch fire at any moment. Mechanical birds can come flying in through the windows. You can be electrocuted, frozen solid, poisoned, or have your skull cracked open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sounds like the safest, best-built train in the world!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong>INCREASE PRESSURE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/01ebba7bbdff5efb9e1a578623d95c33.poster.avif?t=1788201849\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/01ebba7bbdff5efb9e1a578623d95c33.webm?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/01ebba7bbdff5efb9e1a578623d95c33.mp4?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every killer you catch unlocks new challenges, and they don't just make the ride harder - they change the game completely. Uncover new pieces of this world, swat those mechanical birds out of the air, try not to burn alive in the hottest summer on record, and try not to end up as a very large block of ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good luck, detectives. The entire train is counting on you.</strong><strong><u><br>Game in active development, wishlist and follow game to see more!</u></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.poster.avif?t=1788201849\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.webm?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.mp4?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ladies and gentlemen, welcome aboard the Fatal Train.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The killer is hiding among the passengers of the Fatal Train. You and up to three friends have taken on this difficult case - or you're taking it alone, which is worse. But honestly, does anyone care with everything else going on?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ENJOY THE RIDE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/528f1a5de62ac7441ba7f518089bb7e8.poster.avif?t=1788201849\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/528f1a5de62ac7441ba7f518089bb7e8.webm?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/528f1a5de62ac7441ba7f518089bb7e8.mp4?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The train passes through an ENORMOUS number of places, and every one of them leaves something behind. The carriages can catch fire at any moment. Mechanical birds can come flying in through the windows. You can be electrocuted, frozen solid, poisoned, or have your skull cracked open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sounds like the safest, best-built train in the world!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong>INCREASE PRESSURE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/01ebba7bbdff5efb9e1a578623d95c33.poster.avif?t=1788201849\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/01ebba7bbdff5efb9e1a578623d95c33.webm?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/01ebba7bbdff5efb9e1a578623d95c33.mp4?t=1788201849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every killer you catch unlocks new challenges, and they don't just make the ride harder - they change the game completely. Uncover new pieces of this world, swat those mechanical birds out of the air, try not to burn alive in the hottest summer on record, and try not to end up as a very large block of ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good luck, detectives. The entire train is counting on you.</strong><strong><u><br>Game in active development, wishlist and follow game to see more!</u></strong></p>", "short_description": "Murder on the train? It doesn't matter, it's no longer our concern! Ladies and gentlemen, don't worry, we have four detectives who can handle this! After all, there's nothing complicated about murder investigations, right?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as